  "description": {
   "en": "Born into humble origins and possessing only average talent, young Luo Xiu's fate took a turn when he unexpectedly fused with the primordial essence of the Laws of Life and Death. From that moment on, he carried the Wheel of Reincarnation within him, wielding the power to govern life and death itself. With this divine treasure, he forged unmatched supernatural arts, rose to become a supreme Emperor, and stood proudly above all of history—peerless across the ages"
